if(path==="/"){title="Law Firm in Warri, Delta State";body='<section class="hero reference-hero executive-hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">TRUST · JUSTICE · RESULTS</p><h1>Law Firm in Warri &amp; Effurun, Delta State — Strategic Legal Solutions with Integrity and Results</h1><p class="hero-lead">Crest Crown Attorneys is a law firm in Warri, Delta State, based at Urhumarho junction, Effurun, Uvwie 330102, Delta, Nigeria, serving individuals, businesses and corporate organisations across Warri, Effurun and Delta State. We also welcome Nigerian-law enquiries from clients elsewhere in Nigeria and internationally.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/consultation">Schedule a Consultation →</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/about">Explore Our Expertise →</a></div></div></div><div class="hero-photo" role="img" aria-label="Contemporary corporate architecture"><div class="hero-photo-caption"><span>01 / LEGAL COUNSEL</span><strong>Built on trust.<br>Focused on what matters.</strong></div></div></section><section class="wrap section home-contact"><h2>Visit or contact our Effurun office</h2><address class="firm-contact"><strong>Crest Crown Attorneys</strong><br>Urhumarho junction, Effurun, Uvwie 330102, Delta, Nigeria<br><a href="tel:+2348063914606">0806 391 4606</a> · <a href="mailto:crestcrownattorneys@gmail.com">crestcrownattorneys@gmail.com</a><br>Monday–Friday 8am–6pm · Saturday 10am–5pm · Sunday closed</address></section><section class="trust-strip"><div class="wrap"><span><b>01</b> Corporate & Commercial</span><span><b>02</b> Regulatory Advisory</span><span><b>03</b> Dispute Resolution</span><span><b>04</b> Cross-border Enquiries</span></div></section><section class="wrap section executive-practices"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">OUR EXPERTISE / 01</p><h2 class="center-heading">Trusted Guidance for<br>Life and Business.</h2><p class="section-lead center-lead">Professional guidance across core areas of Nigerian law.</p>'+practiceCards()+'<p class="center-link"><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/practice-areas">View All Practice Areas →</a></p></section><section class="about-feature wrap section executive-about"><div class="about-photo" role="img" aria-label="Professional legal office"></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h2>Where Professionalism<br>Meets Purpose.</h2><p>Crest Crown Attorneys is founded on a commitment to dependable legal counsel, careful preparation and a client-focused approach. Led by Eloho Avwaruroro-Okoye, Esq., the firm serves individuals, businesses and corporate organisations.</p><ul><li>Client-focused guidance</li><li>Professional integrity</li><li>Regulatory and commercial experience</li><li>National and international enquiries</li></ul><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/team/eloho">Read Founder’s Profile →</a></div></section><section class="wrap section executive-team"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">OUR PEOPLE / 02</p><h2 class="center-heading">Meet the People Behind the Practice</h2><p class="section-lead center-lead">Get to know the legal practitioners serving individuals and businesses through Crest Crown Attorneys.</p><div class="grid team-grid">'+team.map(profileCard).join('')+'</div></section><section class="wrap section executive-insights"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">PERSPECTIVES / 03</p><h2 class="center-heading">Knowledge That Empowers.</h2><p class="section-lead center-lead">Thoughtful introductions to legal topics affecting people and businesses.</p><div id="home-insights" class="grid insights-grid"><article class="card visual-card"><img loading="lazy" src="'+practiceImages[2]+'" alt="Property law"><div class="visual-card-body"><h3>Property Due Diligence in Nigeria</h3><p>What to understand before acquiring property.</p><a href="/insights">Explore insights →</a></div></article><article class="card visual-card"><img loading="lazy" src="'+practiceImages[1]+'" alt="Commercial agreements"><div class="visual-card-body"><h3>Why Written Contracts Matter</h3><p>Protecting commercial interests through clear agreements.</p><a href="/insights">Explore insights →</a></div></article><article class="card visual-card"><img loading="lazy" src="'+practiceImages[6]+'" alt="Legal proceedings"><div class="visual-card-body"><h3>Understanding Dispute Resolution</h3><p>Options for addressing commercial and civil disputes.</p><a href="/insights">Explore insights →</a></div></article></div></section><section class="approach-section" aria-labelledby="approach-heading"><div class="wrap approach-layout"><div class="approach-intro"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">THE CREST CROWN APPROACH / 04</p><h2 id="approach-heading">Considered advice.<br><em>Decisive action.</em></h2><p>Legal matters deserve more than a standard response. We begin by understanding your priorities, identifying the relevant legal considerations and explaining practical next steps.</p><a class="approach-link" href="/about">Learn about our firm <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="approach-steps"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand your matter</h3><p>We listen, clarify objectives and review the information relevant to your enquiry.</p></div></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Assess your options</h3><p>We explain the applicable legal issues, potential risks and available pathways.</p></div></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Move forward with clarity</h3><p>We agree on an appropriate scope of engagement and communicate the next steps.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="client-pathways"><div class="wrap"><div class="pathways-heading"><p class="eyebrow">WHO WE ASSIST / 05</p><h2>Advice shaped around<br>your circumstances.</h2></div><div class="pathways-grid"><a href="/practice-areas/corporate-commercial-law"><span>01 / BUSINESS</span><h3>Companies & Entrepreneurs</h3><p>Commercial agreements, business formation, governance and regulatory obligations.</p><strong>Explore business services ↗</strong></a><a href="/practice-areas/property-real-estate"><span>02 / INDIVIDUALS</span><h3>Individuals & Families</h3><p>Property transactions, family matters and personal legal concerns.</p><strong>Explore individual services ↗</strong></a><a href="/practice-areas/foreign-investment-nigeria"><span>03 / INTERNATIONAL</span><h3>Overseas & Diaspora Clients</h3><p>Nigerian-law support for cross-border enquiries, investment and local transactions.</p><strong>Explore international services ↗</strong></a></div></div></section><section class="consultation-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Ready to Discuss Your Legal Matter?</h2><p>Arrange an initial consultation with Crest Crown Attorneys.</p><a class="header-cta" href="https://wa.me/2348063914606?text=Hello%20Crest%20Crown%20Attorneys%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20request%20a%20legal%20consultation." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book a Consultation →</a></div></section>';}
